verdict DeleteTake: DeleteTake removes a take and returns its index and main mark; RestoreTake undoes it.
  status: untested
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-recorder/src/types/RecorderOperation.ts#DeleteTake, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-recorder/src/operations/delete-take.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-recorder/src/operations/restore-take.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-recorder/src/capabilities/undo-mappings.ts]
  walkthrough:
    - The operation declares slide and take and returns where the take was. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-recorder/src/types/RecorderOperation.ts#DeleteTake
    - The handler removes the take and reassigns main to the newest remaining. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-recorder/src/operations/delete-take.ts
    - The undo mapping pairs it with RestoreTake, which re-adds it at its index. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-recorder/src/capabilities/undo-mappings.ts
  note: No test invokes DeleteTake, RestoreTake or SelectTake.
```

